{
  "id": "unkindness-saga",
  "title": "The Unkindness Saga: Ravenloft Finale & Ironfist Legacy",
  "description": "<p>The Sunday group's whole run from Wachter House to Kharad-Varr in one module. <strong>Part I — The Cat and the Unkindness</strong>: the Curse of Strahd finale overlay (Arl, Van Richten, Vallaki's cult war, the brides and Finn, three-phase Strahd, the War of Broken Gods with Orcus, Vampyr and Vecna, the Wish, the coffin chase, Barovia's collapse) with 23 walled and lit scenes and a live finale dashboard. <strong>Part II — The Shield Between Us: Ironfist Legacy</strong>: Thorgrinn's homecoming across twelve Sundays, 15 painted battlemaps, <em>the Hold of Kharad-Varr</em> (a linked painted overview of the whole mountain and eight new venue maps — taverns, baths, a gaming house, smith, enchanter, apothecary and rune smiths — each with a self-contained side quest), the full cast, evidence politics, rune magic, original music and the Stone Ledger — with <em>Shadows Beyond Barovia</em> carrying Part I's ending (Dark Power Attention, final choices, mercy, the Wish, the prophecies) into every session. One Manager sets up both parts.</p>",
